title: Contest for the party line
subtitle: A congress or conference will decide which faction's line runs the party.
new-page: true
tags: kpd_event
view-if: line_change_open = 1
on-arrival: {!
// Deterministic contest between the faction holding the line and the strongest challenger. No random rolls.
var names = {right: 'the Right', left: 'the Left', centre: 'the Centre', apparatus: 'the Moscow apparatus'};
function power(f, backed) {
    var p = Q['kf_' + f + '_strength'] - 0.2*Q['kf_' + f + '_dissent'];
    if (f == Q.moscow_favored) { p += 10; }
    if (f == Q.party_line) { p += 5; }
    if (backed) { p += 15; }
    return p;
}
var best = null, bestp = -999;
for (var f of Q.kpd_factions) {
    if (f != Q.party_line) {
        var p = power(f, false);
        if (p > bestp) { best = f; bestp = p; }
    }
}
Q.lc_challenger = best;
Q.lc_holder_name = names[Q.party_line];
Q.lc_challenger_name = names[best];
Q.lc_holder_power = Math.round(power(Q.party_line, false));
Q.lc_challenger_power = Math.round(bestp);
Q.lc_holder_strength = Math.round(Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_strength']);
Q.lc_challenger_strength = Math.round(Q['kf_' + best + '_strength']);
Q.lc_holder_moscow = (Q.party_line == Q.moscow_favored) ? 1 : 0;
Q.lc_challenger_moscow = (best == Q.moscow_favored) ? 1 : 0;
!}

= Contest for the party line

The delegates are gathering. [+ lc_holder_name +] has run the party for [+ party_line_months +] months; [+ lc_challenger_name +] have organised the opposition and want the line changed.

The weight of each side is its strength in the party, minus a fifth of its dissent, plus 10 if Moscow's line favours it, plus 5 for the faction already in power. At present:

[+ lc_holder_name +] (in power): strength [+ lc_holder_strength +], total weight [+ lc_holder_power +][? if lc_holder_moscow = 1 : , Moscow's favoured line ?].

[+ lc_challenger_name +] (challenger): strength [+ lc_challenger_strength +], total weight [+ lc_challenger_power +][? if lc_challenger_moscow = 1 : , Moscow's favoured line ?].

The leadership's own weight counts for 15 more on whichever side it throws it behind. The side with the larger total wins, and there is no chance in it: the decision is ours.

- @support_challenger: Throw our weight behind [+ lc_challenger_name +].
- @defend_line: Defend the present line.

@support_challenger
on-arrival: {!
Q.lc_challenger_power += 15;
!}
go-to: resolve

@defend_line
on-arrival: {!
Q.lc_holder_power += 15;
!}
go-to: resolve

@resolve
on-arrival: {!
var names = {right: 'the Right', left: 'the Left', centre: 'the Centre', apparatus: 'the Moscow apparatus'};
Q.lc_over = 1;
Q.line_change_open = 0;
Q.line_change_timer = 12;
Q.lc_won = (Q.lc_challenger_power > Q.lc_holder_power) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.lc_won) {
    Q.lc_old = Q.party_line;
    Q.lc_old_name = names[Q.party_line];
    Q.party_line = Q.lc_challenger;
    Q.party_line_months = 0;
    Q.party_line_changes += 1;
    Q.zigzag += 3;
    Q['kf_' + Q.lc_old + '_dissent'] += 15;
    Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_dissent'] = Math.max(0, Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_dissent'] - 10);
    if (Q.party_line == Q.moscow_favored) {
        Q.comintern_trust += 8;
    } else if (Q.lc_old == Q.moscow_favored) {
        Q.comintern_trust -= 8;
    }
    Q.lc_new_name = names[Q.party_line];
} else {
    Q['kf_' + Q.lc_challenger + '_dissent'] += 10;
}
!}
go-to: won if lc_won = 1; held if lc_won = 0

@won
title: The line changes

= The line changes

[+ lc_new_name +] now run the party. The line has changed, and the party's members, who were told one thing a year ago, are told another today. We lose credibility with the workers for the sake of it (zigzag +3).

[? if lc_old_name : The defeated side, [+ lc_old_name +], is bitter, and their dissent has risen. ?]

What do we do with its leaders?

- @purge: Remove its leaders from their posts.
- @tolerate: Keep them in the leadership.

@purge
on-arrival: {!
Q['kf_' + Q.lc_old + '_strength'] = Q['kf_' + Q.lc_old + '_strength']/2;
Q['kf_' + Q.lc_old + '_dissent'] = Math.max(0, Q['kf_' + Q.lc_old + '_dissent'] - 10);
Q.workers_kpd -= 2;
Q.unemployed_kpd -= 2;
!}
go-to: root

The leaders of [+ lc_old_name +] are removed from their posts and the faction is cut in half. The party is more unified, and a good many members, who joined for the party's purpose rather than a faction's, leave quietly. A party that settles its arguments by expulsions has to ask itself what it has stopped asking.

@tolerate
go-to: root

The leaders of [+ lc_old_name +] stay in the leadership. Their dissent remains high, and they will use their positions to oppose the new line at every turn until their strength or their patience runs out.

@held
title: The line holds

= The line holds

[+ lc_holder_name +] keep the line. The challengers, [+ lc_challenger_name +], are defeated and unhappy (their dissent has risen), and the party must work with them regardless.

- @root: Return to the work of the party.
